    "recommended_next_step": "Review a separately versioned operational bounded-progress policy before any further case. Preserve science/solver/roster/starts/quadrature/native/runtime and all accepted outputs. Keep the 32-hour cumulative hard cap and 2-thread/6-GiB limits. Admit only a predeclared next-prefix batch under a conservative per-case wall reservation, retaining every attempt and stopping at unresolved/timeout. Recompute resource estimates after each independently audited case; do not call full completion feasible until the amended policy explicitly supports it. A failed case stays incomplete, not a negative result. This is a proposal for source review, not permission to bypass the current gate.",
    "alternative": "Retain the five accepted cases as an incomplete pilot and continue Task2 while developing a better source-informed operational model; no claim of 80-case completion.",
